  "publicPrompt": "Fix pagination boundaries in `src/paginate.ts`. The public API is `paginate<T>(rows: T[], page: number, pageSize: number): { items: T[]; total: number; pageCount: number }`. Pages are one-based. Require positive integer page and pageSize values and throw RangeError otherwise. A past-end page returns no items. Empty input has pageCount 0; other page counts round up. Preserve row order and do not mutate the input.",
